<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>soft n sweet</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Temachii</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">flora maniia</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7b9yHSZhSI6uOry8lsH3vg</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Mia Rasmussen"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Mia Rasmussen"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Gabe Jimenez"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I’m sick at heart, but you know that. The things I’ve learned, I’m a copy cat. I</p><p ttm:agent="v1">hope one day I begin to see the things you tell me, but I don’t think I will. Soft, sweet, things I’ll</p><p ttm:agent="v1">never be, yet you want me. Things I’ll never be. My dear I love some other things. But you’re</p><p ttm:agent="v1">holding onto me like water. (Drown under me.) Our vast desires, so absolute. (Can you feel me?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Can I, can I, go as I please? Soft, sweet, things I’ll never be, yet you want me. Things I’ll never</p><p ttm:agent="v1">be. Let go the thought that it could be, if you could only see, that it’s not.</p></div></body></tt>